[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3]

; The zone around a marked player: a ring on the ground and sparks rising from it. The "Marked"
; reaction adds it under the marked player (place: follow the subject) and removes it 2 seconds
; later (scene_lifetime), so it moves with them. Its origin is the player's feet.

